{"ref":"BDB, יַחֲזִיאֵל","hw":"יַחֲזִיאֵל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יַחֲזִיאֵל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>Ēl sees</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  Benjamite warrior of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.4\">1 Ch 12:4</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  priest of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.6\">1 Ch 16:6</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  a Levite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.19\">1 Ch 23:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.23\">24:23</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  a Levite of the sons of Asaph <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.14\">2 Ch 20:14</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  ancestor of one of the families of the restoration <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:5\" href=\"/Ezra.8.5\">Ezr 8:5</a>.","next":"BDB, יַחְזְיָה","prev":"BDB, חֲזָיָה"}